{"id":"3b256a3873","t":"The Problematic Children of the Magic Tower","c":"cv","n":67,"l":67,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower"},"u":1795038953974,"desc":"ضحّى سيد البرج الأبيض، أوسكار سيج، وسحرة البرج الأبيض بكل شيء، حتى أرواحهم، من أجل مستقبل البشرية. لكن بعد مرور عشرين عامًا، استيقظ أوسكار ليجد نفسه قد بُعث من جديد، ولكن كساحر من المستوى الأول، لا يجيد سوى أبسط فنون السحر. والأسوأ من ذلك، أن البرج الأبيض بات مهددًا بالطرد من بين الأبراج السحرية الأربعة الكبرى. عندها، عقد أوسكار العزم على استعادة مجد البرج الأبيض، مستغلًا فرصته الثانية للنهوض مجددًا.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","بطل غير اعتيادي","خارق للطبيعه","خيال","دراما","سحر","فنتازيا"],"src":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower|/manga/the-problematic-children-of-the-magic-tower/